WEBVTT

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:31.296
and whether or not they think
you might be supporting someone

00:12:31.320 --> 00:12:33.736
just because they look like you.

00:12:33.760 --> 00:12:36.960
If somebody is worthy of your currency,

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:39.616
spend it.

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:42.696
One thing I have learned
after several decades on Wall Street

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:46.136
is the way to grow your power
is to give it away,

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:48.376
and your voice is at the heart.

00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:53.360
(Applause)

00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:59.160
And your voice
is at the heart of your power.

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:01.176
Use it.